    <tr><td><strong>Marine Plywood + Veneer</strong></td><td></td><td>Custom-built units by carpenters, best all-rounder</td><td>Excellent moisture resistance, takes veneer beautifully, strong, dimensionally stable</td><td>Requires skilled finishing, veneer quality varies, not widely available in all cities</td><td>25–40 years</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>BWR Plywood + Laminate</strong></td><td></td><td>Most Indian carpenter-built units — the standard choice</td><td>Boiling water resistant, durable, huge finish variety, cost-effective</td><td>Laminate edges chip if quality is poor, less premium than veneer</td><td>15–25 years</td></tr>
